    <header><p class="kicker">App support</p><h1>Rinklet — Support</h1></header>
    <div class="guide-body">
      <p>Small table. Big rematch. Rinklet is an air-hockey game for iPhone and iPad with computer, local two-player, practice and Game Center online modes.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:podpora@zeleznalady.cz">podpora@zeleznalady.cz</a></p>
      <p>For a game issue, tell us what you were doing, your iPhone or iPad model, your iOS/iPadOS version, the Rinklet version shown in Settings, and what happened. A screenshot can help. Do not send passwords or private account information.</p>
      <h2>Quick start</h2>
      <p>Choose an opponent on the home screen. Drag your mallet within your half of the table. Movement direction and speed shape your shot. Choose 5, 7 or 10 goals before starting. In local two-player mode, both players use the same device at the same time.</p>
      <h2>Table and controller</h2>
      <p>The optional introduction demonstrates the split layout. During solo, practice or online play, choose Table &amp; controller to place the full rink above a separate touch surface. Start anywhere on the lower surface and move your finger to move your mallet. The first touch does not jump the mallet to a new position.</p>
      <h2>Online play</h2>
      <p>Online duel requires internet access and a Game Center account signed in through the system. Choose Online duel to invite a friend or find an opponent. Both players must confirm a resume or rematch. If the connection ends, start a new online duel. Local modes work without Game Center or internet access.</p>
      <h2>Sound and vibration</h2>
      <p>Check Sound and Haptics in Rinklet Settings. Sound follows the device’s silent mode. Haptic feedback is available only on supported devices and can be affected by system settings. These options are independent, so you can keep one enabled and turn the other off.</p>
      <h2>Appearance and language</h2>
      <p>Settings offer Night table, High contrast puck, arena effects and tilt-responsive shadows. The app respects Reduce Motion. Eight languages are available: Czech, Slovak, Polish, German, French, English, Spanish and Simplified Chinese. Select Device language or choose a language directly.</p>
      <h2>Saved matches</h2>
      <p>Your settings and unfinished local match stay on the device. Use Continue match on the home screen to restore a local game. Online matches are not restored as local games. Avoid deleting the app while troubleshooting if you want to retain local data.</p>
      <p>Rinklet requires iOS/iPadOS 26.0 or later. It contains no ads or in-app purchases.</p>
      <p><a href="/en/apps/rinklet/">Game features</a> · <a href="/en/rinklet/privacy/">Rinklet privacy</a> · <a href="/en/privacy/">VCode website privacy</a></p>
